<title>FRANCE: Carrefour sales up 12.9 pct in November.</title>
<headline>Carrefour sales up 12.9 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eleven months to Nov 30, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				     154,698    up  7.3 pct</p>
<p>	- includes turnover in France	 91,802    up  3.6 pct</p>
<p>    November turnover			   15,252    up 12.9 pct</p>
<p>	- includes turnover in France	  8,955    up  6.7 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Carrefour gave its sales results, excluding sales tax, in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it opened its second and third stores in Korea in November, a third store in China, a 44th in Brazil, a 53rd in Spain and a sixth in Italy.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
